# 📋 Offline Task Kanban

> **CNTXT Pseudo-App Runtime**: In the CNTXT editor, this document renders an interactive visual Kanban board. The board state synchronizes with the structured markdown lists below.

```cntxt-app:kanban
columns:
  - id: backlog
    title: Backlog
    limit: 10
  - id: in_progress
    title: In Progress
    limit: 3
  - id: review
    title: Review / QA
    limit: 5
  - id: done
    title: Shipped
```

